  "name": "Thinkful-Unit3-Lesson2-Assignment4",
  "description": "A Python-based ETL utility designed to ingest structured pet records from CSV files into a PostgreSQL relational database. The implementation utilizes the psycopg2 adapter to execute parameterized bulk insertions into a normalized schema comprising pets, breeds, species, and shelter entities. It demonstrates core database interaction patterns including connection lifecycle management, transaction control, and DDL execution for schema initialization.",
